<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    padding: '0 72px',
    background: '#FFFFFF',
}}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 720, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{
            height: 120,
            paddingTop: 20,
            paddingBottom: 16,
            flexDirection: 'column',
            justifyContent: 'flex-end',
        }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 6, background: '#97C459', marginBottom: 14 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0B1F1A' }}>
                The problem, in our own words
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 44 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 655, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{
                    fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono',
                    fontSize: 14,
                    color: '#6B7280',
                    letterSpacing: 1.8,
                }}>
                    WHAT THE BRIEF ASKS FOR
                </Text>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 17, color: '#97C459', width: 26 }}>
                        01
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 19, lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#0B1F1A', flex: 1 }}>
                        Keep the user entertained and the conversation alive,
                        <span style={{ color: '#6B7280' }}> without losing logical depth or core functionality</span>
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 17, color: '#97C459', width: 26 }}>
                        02
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 19, lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#0B1F1A', flex: 1 }}>
                        Handle and recover from real-time interruptions,
                        <span style={{ color: '#6B7280' }}> while still driving the conversation toward the end goal</span>
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 17, color: '#97C459', width: 26 }}>
                        03
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 19, lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#0B1F1A', flex: 1 }}>
                        Cater to changes in goals,
                        <span style={{ color: '#6B7280' }}> without losing the relevant session context</span>
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 17, color: '#97C459', width: 26 }}>
                        04
                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 19, lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#0B1F1A', flex: 1 }}>
                        Build a solid harness around the agent,
                        <span style={{ color: '#6B7280' }}> safe and reliable enough to trust with state</span>
                    </Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ height: 2, background: '#E1F5EE', marginTop: 6 }} />

                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 18, lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#0F6E56', fontWeight: 600 }}>
                    Read together, those are not four features. They are one requirement — and stating it that way is what made the work testable.
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{
                width: 437,
                flexDirection: 'column',
                background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #E1F5EE 0%, #FFFFFF 100%)',
                borderLeft: '6px solid #97C459',
                padding: '30px 30px 26px 30px',
            }}>
                <Text style={{
                    fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono',
                    fontSize: 14,
                    color: '#0F6E56',
                    letterSpacing: 1.8,
                }}>
                    THE ONE REQUIREMENT
                </Text>

                <Text style={{
                    fontFamily: 'Inter',
                    fontSize: 23,
                    fontWeight: 'bold',
                    lineHeight: 1.5,
                    color: '#04342C',
                    marginTop: 22,
                }}>
                    At any instant the system must state what it is doing, what it believes, and which of its in-flight actions are still valid — and it must never say something it cannot yet back with evidence.
                </Text>

                <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 22 }}>
                    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: 'rgba(15,110,86,0.25)', marginBottom: 18 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.6, color: '#0B1F1A' }}>
                        <span style={{ color: '#6B7280' }}>“Be interruptible” is not testable.</span>
                        <br />
                        <span style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 15, color: '#0F6E56' }}>
                            “Publish a snapshot on every event, and prove a revision cancels only the work it invalidated”
                        </span>
                        <span style={{ color: '#6B7280' }}> is.</span>
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{
            height: 60,
            paddingBottom: 20,
            flexDirection: 'row',
            alignItems: 'center',
            justifyContent: 'space-between',
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Inter', fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7280' }}>
                Talent Atlas · Samsung PRISM Y2026 · Theme 05
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'JetBrains Mono', fontSize: 14, color: '#6B7280' }}>
                02 / 12
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
